program uint32rotate;
{ Observe the entire 64-bit destination immediately after a 32-bit rotation.
  AMD APM 24594 ROL/ROR and table B-1; Arm DDI0487 M.c EXTR/RORV and X accessor.
  A nonzero upper half is copied immediately before the instruction. }
